      "value": {
        "value": "The source states that Figure 5 omits heights lower than the corresponding CdSe/ZnS diameter, while underlying methods count all features. However, the plotted yellow histograms retain visible approximately 3–4 nm features below the 4.4 nm core/shell mean. The exact implemented filter and raw distributions cannot be established; the stated selection rule is not a verified strict cutoff.",
